{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control a directionless man who left everything behind to climb a Mountain and find his life's purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be careful! Every step is precise, keep your balance like a drunk and rethink your steps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climbing can be a challenge if you are not careful and patient!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHEN THE SKY FADES, MELODIES SOFTLY EMERGE GUIDING YOUR STEPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/05228_2_.gif?t=1751739860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT PURPOSE YOU ARE LOOKING FOR IN LIFE?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/GIF002.gif?t=1751739860\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INTRODUCING</strong>: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based climbing and walking, with a focus on realistic balance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character balance mechanics \u2014 keep our (slightly tipsy) adventurer on his feet! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day and night cycle, with real-time transitions accompanied by soothing soundtracks at each sunrise and sunset. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Independent use of legs and arms \u2014 coordination is everything here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE GUARDIAN BEAST OF THE MOUNTAIN AWAITS YOU!!!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/Dragon__2_.gif?t=1751739860\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741250?t=1751739860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741250?t=1751739860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/2fcd7e88c992f88a6e600cb24b3aa3e1ac5f0b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751739860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/2fcd7e88c992f88a6e600cb24b3aa3e1ac5f0b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751739860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3760320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control a directionless man who